        "@value": "JazzTimes Magazine writes that British Columbia-based jazz vocalist Angela Verbrugge \"possesses a winsome, brightly- burnished, pliable voice, with ample emotional intelligence, considerable song-writing skills, and conspicuously good taste.”"
