        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tuesday Jam Hosted by Tom Van Seters - The Yardbird Suite"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The music of jazz pianist and composer Tom Van Seters has been described as lyrical, thoughtful, and sophisticated.  While his refined sensibilities and attention to detail reveal a background in classical music, his love of hard swinging rhythms places him firmly in the modern jazz tradition."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
