        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Secondhand Dreamcar has been percolating for the better part of a year, working at refining their impressive live shows and finding time to record a debut album that will be released in the fall of this year. It’s not an overreach to call this unit a all-star aggregation or the cream of the crop."
      }
