      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Alberta based songwriter, recording artist and producer Mike Clark is staple on the music scene in his home province and across Canada, as well as internationally as a horn section member of Tommy Castro's Revue on the Legendary Rhythm and Blues Cruises."
      }
    ],
