        "@value": "Up and Over Trio is Alberta’s hottest new modern jazz group featuring Galaxie Rising Star Award recipient Chris Andrew on piano, 2018 WCMA Jazz Artist of the Year winner Rubim de Toledo on bass, and Alberta’s top call jazz drummer Jamie Cooper."
