        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tuesday Jam Hosted by Ubre Blanca - The Yardbird Suite"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Named after a prodigious milk-producing Cuban cow, Ubre Blanca is a new latin jazz unit created with the intent to explore and better understand the rhythms and stylistic underpinnings of music from Latin America, notably Cuban and Brazilian music."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
