        "@value": "Join Edmonton’s own musical powerhouse, award-winning Mallory Chipman, for a special performance with a six piece band, featuring a never before seen Acoustic Set, followed up by a full band Electric Set live at the Yardbird Suite as she kicks off her fall tour."
      }
    ],
